│                                                                    │
│  1 Python 3.9+ Behavior:                                           │
│     • In Python 3.9+, @classmethod and @property now inherit the   │
│       __doc__ attribute from the wrapped descriptor (e.g.,         │
│       property()).                                                 │
│     • This change does not affect the __doc__ attribute of the     │
│       wrapped descriptor, but Sphinx does not document methods     │
│       that are decorated with both @classmethod and @property.     │
│  2 Sphinx Documentation Behavior:                                  │
