│ ┃       Patch to Fix Sphinx Documentation for Methods with       ┃ │
│ ┃                   @classmethod and @property                   ┃ │
│ ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛ │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue arises because Sphinx does not document methods          │
│ decorated with both @classmethod and @property in Python 3.9+.     │
│ This is due to a change in how the __doc__ attribute is inherited  │
│ from wrapped descriptors, but Sphinx does not automatically pick   │
│ it up. The solution involves updating the Sphinx configuration to  │
│ ensure proper documentation of such methods.                       │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│                            🛠️ Reasoning                             │
│                                                                    │
│ Sphinx's autodoc module does not automatically document methods    │
│ decorated with both @classmethod and @property when the __doc__    │
│ attribute is present. This is because the @property decorator does │
│ not explicitly set __doc__ in the same way as @classmethod, and    │
│ Sphinx does not recognize the combined decorator combination as a  │
│ valid documentation target. The fix involves ensuring that Sphinx  │
│ correctly captures and documents the __doc__ attribute from the    │
│ wrapped descriptor.                                                │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│                              📄 Patch                              │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  [file]docs/conf.py[/file]                                         │
│  [original]                                                        │
│  autodoc_member_order = 'bysource'                                 │
│  </                                                                │
│                                                                    │
